*.swp

# Repo-specific docs that don't need to ship in the image
docs/
# ...except the capability statement. The Dockerfile COPYs it and the site links
# it publicly at /docs/big7-capability-statement.pdf. Without this negation the
# image has failed to build since 2026-07-20 — d78f9b0 added the COPY that day,
# while the docs/ rule above dates from 94a237c on 2026-07-03. Caught 2026-08-04,
# the first time the container smoke test was run since.
!docs/big7-capability-statement.pdf
tests/
BRD.md
TRD.md
RUNBOOK.md
ONBOARDING.md
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
SECURITY.md
CLAUDE.md
LICENSE
README.md

# Build scripts (not needed inside the nginx container)
build.sh
build.bat
Makefile
setup.sh
setup.bat
run.sh
run.bat
